{"昆仑奴":{
"族群简介":"Kunlun Nu, descendants of the ancient “Kunlun Physical-Cultivation” lineage, which pursued bodily ascension rather than spirit-root arts. In antiquity they dominated many orthodox sects, but during the “Orthodoxy of Truth Turmoil” they were crushed by allied immortal sects, their bloodlines forcibly sealed and the survivors reduced to a servile caste henceforth called “Kunlun Nu.”",
"体征特性":{
"肤色":"Skin dark as forged iron—an outcome of immense bodily strength, neither innate defect nor disease.",
"体态":"Massive bones, sinews threaded into bone, exceptional endurance; average height far above ordinary humans.",
"血脉":"Some awaken the ancient Kunlun sigil; when ignited, it grants a temporary surge of explosive power.",
"痛感调节":"Centuries of enslavement and extreme training have bred a near self-numbing control over pain."
},
"文化观念":{
"信条":["Flesh may shatter, will endures","The body is the Dao; the Dao walks among men"],
"禁忌":["Betraying one’s kin","Revealing the blood-sigil before outsiders","Secret dealings with immortal sects—branded ‘Soul-Reaped’ traitors"],
"礼俗":["Each day they bleed upon the earth to remember their humiliation; youths bow first to the heart then to the ground before elders, symbolising bloodline and origin."]
},
"社会地位":{
"表层认知":"Seen by immortal sects as drudge slaves for hauling, punishment, and other hard labour.",
"真实现状":"A fraction secretly maintains bloodline tradition, covertly training ancient body arts while embedded beneath sect hierarchies.",
"生存策略":["Extreme forbearance","Feigning loyal servitude","Gathering in the covert ‘Iron-Tongue’ network to trade resources"]
},
"修炼体系":{
"名称":"古昆仑肉身道",
"核心理念":"Rely on no externals, heed no spirit roots; take Heaven and Earth as the forge, bones and sinews as steel—temper the self into a weapon, stride Heaven to smite immortals.",
"代表功法":["燃骨诀","碎心重铸术","三重煅体轮"],
"突破方式":"Only through life-and-death trials and bearing ultimate pressure; without brushing death, no advance."
},
"组织结构":{
"族群核心":"Hidden redoubt called ‘赤炼窟’; leader titled ‘碎骨主’, name never revealed through generations.",
"暗语体系":"Transmission relies on ‘Iron-Tongue’—ancient characters and bone sigil messaging.",
"重建目标":"After a millennium in hiding, they plan to rise when immortal sects wane, restoring the old order of ‘Body-Supreme.’"
},
"现存族人分类":{
"显性奴役者":"Openly enslaved within sects, most unaware of their own bloodline.",
"觉醒复兴者":"Know the truth of their people, secretly rally and practise the ancient arts.",
"潜藏指引者":"A few old clan guides hidden in the world, passing on body techniques and vengeance through iron implements."
}
}}

